<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P says Indosuez Australia on positive watch.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P says Indosuez Australia on positive watch.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Friday it placed the A plus long-term and A1 short-term counterparty ratings of Indosuez Australia Ltd on creditwatch with positive implications.  </p>
<p>The ratings agency said the action was conducted in conjunction with a similar move on the company's French parent and guarantor Banque Indosuez.</p>
<p>It said the creditwatch will be resolved after it has examined the implications of the parent's purchase by Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole on December 23.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
